	     tune weight (their CV element is weightTune), so they use include_only_weights="1,2": the
	     selection x the non-GENIE part of the weight x the knob weight.  The flux, SCC and kaon knob
	     weights are relative to the CV (CV element = 1), so they use the full weight (no
	     include_only_weights). -->

